Subject: [PATCH] Allow local Audio Eraser packages

Accept exact packages from Settings.System.unica_scpm_allowlist_packages
when SystemUI filters active playback apps for the Audio Eraser panel. This
keeps the stock SoundAlive AudioEraserProvider/SCPM flow intact, but lets the
UN1CA SCPM Allowlist menu add extra media apps locally.
